post-it: Computer smells weird and won't start
symptoms:
	Restarts by itself
	Slow computer
checks:
	Freezes a moment after the desktop appears
		shows: a second after the desktop appears, the sound sags and freezes in a buzz, and the computer reboots
	Something blocks the CPU fan
		shows: in the Workview, a dead hamster lies on the fan
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	If something blocks the fan, take it out and throw it in the trash
	Remount the shell
notes:
	Broken part: None. A hamster lies on the fan; the fan itself is fine. Take the hamster out to fix it.
	One exception on purpose: Hamster has the symptoms of Dust Overheat, and the player tells them apart by opening the computer.
